WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:34.290
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:34.560 --> 01:35.600
Yes, it's set.

3
01:36.039 --> 01:38.880
The trial is scheduled for next Wednesday at 9:00 AM

4
01:38.880 --> 01:40.080
in Courtroom 32.

5
01:40.440 --> 01:42.680
Okay, I'll be there early.

6
01:45.360 --> 01:46.320
Morning, Sister Long.

7
01:46.320 --> 01:46.880
Morning.

8
01:51.400 --> 01:52.720
For the guarantee liability case,

9
01:52.720 --> 01:55.920
the client accidentally deleted the chat history, right?

10
01:55.920 --> 01:56.560
Yes, Director.

11
01:56.560 --> 01:59.160
But there are specialized shops in the computer mall that can recover it.

12
01:59.160 --> 02:01.080
Then hurry and take the phone to the computer mall.

13
02:01.080 --> 02:01.400
Okay.

14
02:01.400 --> 02:02.120
Dong Beihu.

15
02:10.479 --> 02:11.320
I forgot.

16
02:11.920 --> 02:14.560
Luo Zhi, could you make a trip?

17
02:15.240 --> 02:16.360
Since Uncle isn't here,

18
02:16.360 --> 02:17.960
you'll have to work a bit harder.

19
02:17.960 --> 02:19.079
No problem, Director.

20
02:19.079 --> 02:20.360
I... I'll go right now.

21
02:24.920 --> 02:25.440
Hello.

22
02:25.960 --> 02:26.960
Is Lawyer Xiao here?

23
02:26.960 --> 02:27.880
Lawyer Xiao is inside.

24
02:27.880 --> 02:29.210
What are you doing here?

25
02:29.400 --> 02:31.000
I'm looking for Lawyer Xiao.

26
02:31.440 --> 02:33.720
Lawyer Xiao, long time no see.

27
02:35.600 --> 02:36.360
Pan.

28
02:36.440 --> 02:38.800
The paperwork for my new law firm is approved.

29
02:38.800 --> 02:39.880
This lawsuit,

30
02:41.240 --> 02:42.170
I'm dropping it.

31
02:42.840 --> 02:45.500
I've already agreed to their settlement terms.

32
02:46.040 --> 02:46.920
Lawyer Xiao,

33
02:48.120 --> 02:49.040
I'm sorry.

34
02:50.320 --> 02:52.079
No, take this back.

35
02:52.079 --> 02:53.880
Lawyer Xiao doesn't need to see you now.

36
02:53.880 --> 02:54.680
Lawyer Xiao,

37
02:54.800 --> 02:56.480
please help me again.

38
02:56.480 --> 02:58.320
All my shrimp died again this year.

39
02:58.320 --> 02:59.240
Look.

40
02:59.480 --> 03:01.840
I think Wangang definitely did it again.

41
03:02.640 --> 03:04.880
I lost everything.

42
03:04.880 --> 03:06.680
If you lost everything, go home.

43
03:06.800 --> 03:07.800
Why are you looking for Sister Long?

44
03:07.800 --> 03:09.240
Go ask Wangang for it.

45
03:11.160 --> 03:12.480
I have no proof.

46
03:12.880 --> 03:13.680
Lawyer Xiao,

47
03:14.760 --> 03:16.820
what happened last time was my fault.

48
03:16.880 --> 03:18.400
Please be the bigger person.

49
03:18.400 --> 03:20.000
Please help me one more time.

50
03:22.640 --> 03:23.640
I'm sorry.

51
03:23.680 --> 03:24.940
I won't take this case.

52
03:25.360 --> 03:26.360
Did you hear that?

53
03:26.440 --> 03:27.160
Just go.

54
03:27.240 --> 03:28.360
Why are you still here?

55
03:28.360 --> 03:29.560
Luo Zhi, take the stuff away.

56
03:29.560 --> 03:29.880
Hurry up.

57
03:29.880 --> 03:30.480
No, no, no.

58
03:30.480 --> 03:30.800
Go, go, go.

59
03:30.800 --> 03:31.560
No, you keep it.

60
03:31.560 --> 03:32.600
Go, go, go. We don't want it.

61
03:32.600 --> 03:34.120
Don't come to our law firm for this kind of thing in the future.

62
03:34.120 --> 03:35.600
We don't want your stuff. Hurry up and leave.

63
03:35.600 --> 03:35.920
Uncle.

64
03:35.920 --> 03:36.800
Lawyer Xiao.

65
03:36.800 --> 03:38.130
Uncle, don't come back.

66
03:39.040 --> 03:40.520
Whenever there's a problem, you come to Lawyer Xiao.

67
03:40.520 --> 03:43.200
But at the critical moment, you back out and drop the ball.

68
03:43.200 --> 03:44.200
I understand now.

69
03:44.520 --> 03:46.200
The director helped him before.

70
03:46.200 --> 03:48.400
And then he went back on his word, right?

71
03:49.079 --> 03:50.200
If it weren't for him,

72
03:50.200 --> 03:51.040
would Sister Long be like this?

73
03:51.040 --> 03:51.800
Enough.

74
03:52.320 --> 03:53.920
Stop nagging about the past.

75
03:54.640 --> 03:55.680
Let's get down to business.

76
03:55.680 --> 03:56.610
Go get the phone.

77
04:00.680 --> 04:01.520
Excuse me.

78
04:09.960 --> 04:10.890
Hello, Yang Fan.

79
04:11.560 --> 04:12.920
We need to meet on Sunday afternoon.

80
04:12.920 --> 04:14.520
And your social security details,

81
04:14.520 --> 04:15.560
you need to prepare them.

82
04:15.560 --> 04:17.560
Mr. Tian, I've been traveling a lot lately.

83
04:17.560 --> 04:19.640
I might have to trouble you to run the errands for me.

84
04:19.640 --> 04:20.399
No problem.

85
04:21.160 --> 04:22.079
You're back.

86
04:24.480 --> 04:25.880
Are you very tired today?

87
04:26.160 --> 04:27.720
You don't look so good.

88
04:28.000 --> 04:28.930
Have some water.

89
04:31.160 --> 04:31.880
Honey.

90
04:32.320 --> 04:34.400
I might be busy for a while again.

91
04:34.720 --> 04:35.920
When are you not busy?

92
04:37.040 --> 04:38.120
I'm sorry.

93
04:39.240 --> 04:40.320
Silly.

94
04:40.840 --> 04:42.440
I'll go heat up the food.

95
04:47.920 --> 04:50.560
The Market Supervision Bureau is coming for an inspection the day after tomorrow.

96
04:50.560 --> 04:51.560
Later, check the store's

97
04:51.560 --> 04:53.400
inspection certificates for special equipment

98
04:53.400 --> 04:54.320
to see if they are compliant.

99
04:54.320 --> 04:54.920
Welcome.

100
04:54.920 --> 04:56.250
Don't worry, Lawyer Li.

101
04:56.280 --> 04:59.000
I can't believe you had to come all the way here for such a small matter.

102
04:59.000 --> 05:01.040
Mr. Wan really values young Mr. Wan.

103
05:01.320 --> 05:02.450
Stop being jealous.

104
05:02.960 --> 05:04.560
Let's get this done quickly.

105
05:05.800 --> 05:07.660
Reincarnation is really a skill.

106
05:10.280 --> 05:12.540
Why does that look so much like Big Tiger?

107
05:17.360 --> 05:18.620
It really is Big Tiger.

108
05:23.720 --> 05:24.960
Welcome.

109
05:26.840 --> 05:27.440
Come on.

110
05:27.520 --> 05:29.320
Come visit my office.

111
05:29.320 --> 05:30.380
It's right inside.

112
05:31.040 --> 05:31.900
It's quite big.

113
05:32.120 --> 05:33.450
A bit bigger than yours.

114
05:33.520 --> 05:34.250
A lot bigger.

115
05:34.480 --> 05:36.540
Makes sense. Land is expensive here.

116
05:38.480 --> 05:41.010
Does she know you're working part-time here?

117
05:42.760 --> 05:43.480
It's not part-time.

118
05:43.480 --> 05:45.320
I quit my other job.

119
05:45.720 --> 05:47.280
This is my main job now.

120
05:48.680 --> 05:49.940
Because of the stocks?

121
05:50.840 --> 05:52.040
Don't worry about it.

122
05:54.120 --> 05:54.640
All right.

123
05:54.640 --> 05:57.159
Your status has changed drastically.

124
05:57.480 --> 05:59.080
You've become Mr. Dong now.

125
05:59.760 --> 06:01.520
This whole area belongs to my childhood friend.

126
06:01.520 --> 06:02.560
He specifically invited me over

127
06:02.560 --> 06:04.020
to help him manage things.

128
06:04.880 --> 06:06.480
Wan Zhuoli is your childhood friend?

129
06:06.480 --> 06:07.680
We're best buddies.

130
06:07.840 --> 06:10.000
We've been inseparable since we were kids.

131
06:10.000 --> 06:10.800
We're family.

132
06:11.800 --> 06:13.930
Lawyer Xiao also treats you as family.

133
06:13.960 --> 06:15.290
You just left like that.

134
06:15.640 --> 06:17.370
Did you consider her feelings?

135
06:20.640 --> 06:22.160
Haven't you always wanted me

136
06:22.160 --> 06:23.690
to stop hanging around her?

137
06:23.800 --> 06:25.330
Isn't this what you wanted?

138
06:37.760 --> 06:38.680
Dad, I'm back.

139
06:39.040 --> 06:39.640
You're back.

140
06:39.640 --> 06:41.159
Hurry up and eat. Come on.

141
06:41.840 --> 06:42.760
What did you make?

142
06:42.760 --> 06:45.200
Tiger salad, tiger skin chicken feet,

143
06:45.480 --> 06:46.200
tiger skin braised pork,

144
06:46.200 --> 06:47.440
and tiger skin green peppers.

145
06:47.440 --> 06:48.720
They are all tiger-beating dishes.

146
06:48.720 --> 06:49.520
Eat up.

147
06:49.760 --> 06:51.820
Who told that guy to be so ungrateful?

148
06:54.720 --> 06:55.880
Hello.

149
06:56.560 --> 06:57.840
Let's have dinner together tonight.

150
06:57.840 --> 06:59.440
I'm not going. My dad cooked.

151
06:59.480 --> 07:00.040
Who is it?

152
07:00.120 --> 07:00.760
Li Xin.

153
07:00.840 --> 07:01.880
Then go with him.

154
07:01.880 --> 07:02.960
Don't worry about me.

155
07:02.960 --> 07:03.560
What about you?

156
07:03.560 --> 07:04.520
I'll ask Lao Li to come over

157
07:04.520 --> 07:06.040
and have a drink with me.

158
07:06.880 --> 07:08.520
Then I'll come find you in a bit.

159
07:08.520 --> 07:09.760
Okay, see you later.

160
07:35.800 --> 07:39.200
Longnv, can you come to the hospital now?

161
07:52.000 --> 07:52.760
Attorney Li.

162
07:52.760 --> 07:53.690
Sister-in-law.

163
07:54.240 --> 07:55.770
How is the old squad leader?

164
07:57.040 --> 07:59.970
He was fine when he went out the day before yesterday.

165
08:00.040 --> 08:01.240
But I don't know why,

166
08:01.920 --> 08:03.000
on his way back,

167
08:03.760 --> 08:04.840
he just collapsed.

168
08:05.040 --> 08:07.570
The doctor said it was a cerebral hemorrhage.

169
08:08.720 --> 08:09.960
It's been two days,

170
08:10.720 --> 08:12.320
and he still hasn't woken up.

171
08:15.560 --> 08:18.120
I kept telling him to take care of his health.

172
08:18.120 --> 08:19.280
Don't work so hard.

173
08:20.080 --> 08:20.960
But a while ago,

174
08:20.960 --> 08:23.620
he was always working overtime until very late.

175
08:23.920 --> 08:26.240
Sometimes the kids were already asleep when he got back,

176
08:26.240 --> 08:28.840
and he would continue working until midnight.

177
08:29.280 --> 08:31.540
I never thought it would be this serious.

178
08:37.440 --> 08:39.480
The doctor just asked if we should

179
08:40.720 --> 08:41.520
pull the plug.

180
08:43.520 --> 08:44.450
Absolutely not.

181
08:44.840 --> 08:46.520
Sister-in-law, we can't give up.

182
08:46.520 --> 08:47.480
As long as we can save Xiaotian,

183
08:47.480 --> 08:48.680
money is not an issue.

184
08:48.800 --> 08:50.000
Yes, sister-in-law.

185
08:50.080 --> 08:51.960
If you don't have enough money, I have some.

186
08:51.960 --> 08:54.080
Don't worry. It's fine.

187
08:58.240 --> 08:59.880
I regret to inform the family and friends

188
08:59.880 --> 09:01.240
that the patient's heart

189
09:01.240 --> 09:02.760
has just stopped.

190
09:39.640 --> 09:40.240
Miaomiao.

191
09:52.920 --> 09:55.360
These are all former clients

192
09:55.360 --> 09:57.360
of our old class monitor.

193
09:58.040 --> 09:59.570
They came here on their own.

194
10:02.160 --> 10:03.090
Sister-in-law.

195
10:03.760 --> 10:04.690
My condolences.

196
10:05.680 --> 10:06.360
Thank you.

197
10:07.440 --> 10:08.770
That's very kind of you.

198
10:16.240 --> 10:17.570
Distinguished guests,

199
10:17.680 --> 10:19.000
family and friends,

200
10:20.000 --> 10:23.280
today we gather with heavy hearts

201
10:23.680 --> 10:26.080
to bid farewell to lawyer Tian Yonghou.

202
10:26.880 --> 10:29.240
Now, please welcome the deceased's good friend,

203
10:29.240 --> 10:31.500
lawyer Xiao Longnv, to deliver a speech.

204
10:42.000 --> 10:44.120
Respected elders,

205
10:46.360 --> 10:49.200
relatives, friends, and guests.

206
10:52.280 --> 10:53.000
Thank you all

207
10:53.000 --> 10:56.800
for coming today to see lawyer Tian Yonghou off on his final journey.

208
11:05.720 --> 11:07.000
Tian Yonghou

209
11:08.680 --> 11:11.080
was my college classmate.

210
11:11.440 --> 11:13.600
He was the monitor of our class.

211
11:15.520 --> 11:16.760
He was the oldest,

212
11:16.800 --> 11:17.720
so,

213
11:18.320 --> 11:21.180
our classmates all loved to call him 'old monitor'.

214
11:21.840 --> 11:23.160
As for our old monitor,

215
11:23.160 --> 11:24.440
Always remembered. Rest in peace.

216
11:24.440 --> 11:24.720
he always had a really great temper.

217
11:24.720 --> 11:25.960
he always had a really great temper.

218
11:25.960 --> 11:26.960
In my eyes,

219
11:28.080 --> 11:29.210
he was my role model.

220
11:29.640 --> 11:30.800
He was the most

221
11:31.520 --> 11:32.640
responsible,

222
11:34.200 --> 11:35.320
earnest,

223
11:37.240 --> 11:40.520
and dedicated lawyer to his clients I knew.

224
11:42.200 --> 11:43.600
He truly managed to

225
11:43.600 --> 11:45.760
wield the sword of justice.

226
11:49.720 --> 11:52.480
That's why I say our old monitor

227
11:55.000 --> 11:57.360
was a good man.

228
11:59.160 --> 12:00.400
He must have

229
12:02.320 --> 12:04.760
gone up early to enjoy his rewards.

230
12:17.680 --> 12:19.680
Dad, Dad, wake up.

231
12:20.400 --> 12:22.440
Dad, Dad, wake up.

232
12:25.040 --> 12:27.320
Mom, Dad is ignoring me.

233
13:01.360 --> 13:03.620
Don't they say good people are rewarded?

234
13:04.400 --> 13:06.800
The old squad leader was such a good person.

235
13:07.520 --> 13:08.650
Where is his reward?

236
13:09.120 --> 13:10.080
He's just gone.

237
13:10.080 --> 13:12.760
This is too unfair.

238
13:16.600 --> 13:18.060
Life is so unpredictable.

239
13:19.360 --> 13:19.960
Really.

240
13:22.600 --> 13:23.000
But Xiaolong,

241
13:23.000 --> 13:24.400
I think the most important thing right now is

242
13:24.400 --> 13:27.200
how the old squad leader's wife and child will survive.

243
13:27.200 --> 13:29.360
If the old squad leader

244
13:29.400 --> 13:31.800
was really working overtime on the day he passed away,

245
13:31.800 --> 13:34.880
then we need to apply for work-related injury certification as soon as possible

246
13:34.880 --> 13:36.410
to fight for compensation.

247
13:38.360 --> 13:39.000
Right.

248
13:39.520 --> 13:41.720
I overlooked such an important matter.

249
13:41.920 --> 13:42.520
It's okay.

250
13:43.960 --> 13:44.760
I'm here.

251
13:49.600 --> 13:50.720
As for Yonghou,

252
13:50.960 --> 13:53.490
he has been working for me since he graduated.

253
13:53.680 --> 13:56.480
I truly want to help him from the bottom of my heart.

254
13:56.480 --> 13:58.080
But when he had the attack,

255
13:58.280 --> 13:59.280
it was on a weekend

256
13:59.680 --> 14:01.040
and on the subway.

257
14:01.360 --> 14:02.440
It's a bit tricky.

258
14:06.840 --> 14:07.640
Director Liu,

259
14:08.360 --> 14:09.640
can it be certified?

260
14:09.840 --> 14:11.000
It still depends on whether Lawyer Tian

261
14:11.000 --> 14:12.730
was actually working that day.

262
14:12.880 --> 14:13.680
As long as we can prove

263
14:13.680 --> 14:16.680
that taking the subway was for work-related matters,

264
14:16.920 --> 14:18.520
wouldn't the weekend and the subway

265
14:18.520 --> 14:20.880
also be considered working hours and workplace?

266
14:20.880 --> 14:22.540
Whether he went to work or not,

267
14:22.720 --> 14:24.200
I really don't know.

268
14:24.320 --> 14:26.440
Then Director Liu, how about this?

269
14:26.760 --> 14:27.400
Could you give us the old squad leader's

270
14:27.400 --> 14:29.400
work materials from when he was alive,

271
14:29.400 --> 14:30.730
so we can look for clues?

272
14:31.000 --> 14:33.000
A lawyer's work files

273
14:33.360 --> 14:35.360
involve client privacy.

274
14:35.880 --> 14:37.760
We definitely can't give them to you.

275
14:37.760 --> 14:39.360
Director Liu, one more thing.

276
14:39.360 --> 14:39.960
Did our firm

277
14:39.960 --> 14:42.360
pay work injury insurance for Lawyer Tian?

278
14:42.600 --> 14:44.960
In a law firm of my scale,

279
14:45.280 --> 14:47.760
lawyers pay their own insurance.

280
14:48.360 --> 14:50.560
That's a common understanding, right?

281
15:01.000 --> 15:01.960
His wife said

282
15:02.480 --> 15:04.600
our old squad leader wanted to save money,

283
15:04.600 --> 15:07.000
so he didn't pay for work injury insurance.

284
15:07.600 --> 15:08.640
In that case,

285
15:08.840 --> 15:11.320
the compensation that should have been covered by social security

286
15:11.320 --> 15:13.580
will all have to be paid by their law firm.

287
15:13.760 --> 15:16.080
Then Liu Xincheng definitely won't be happy about it.

288
15:16.080 --> 15:17.480
It's a lot of money.

289
15:21.480 --> 15:21.840
That day at

290
15:21.840 --> 15:22.400
the ICU

291
15:22.400 --> 15:23.240
entrance.

292
15:23.320 --> 15:25.600
This Liu Xincheng looks a bit strange.

293
15:26.320 --> 15:28.180
Sister-in-law, we can't give up.

294
15:28.360 --> 15:29.600
As long as we can save Xiaotian,

295
15:29.600 --> 15:30.860
money is not a problem.

296
15:30.920 --> 15:33.160
I regret to inform all relatives and friends

297
15:33.160 --> 15:34.220
that the patient's

298
15:34.440 --> 15:36.240
heart has just stopped beating.

299
15:38.040 --> 15:39.000
I didn't expect this.

300
15:39.000 --> 15:40.800
He timed it perfectly, didn't he?

301
15:40.800 --> 15:42.360
He just wanted to drag it out past 48 hours

302
15:42.360 --> 15:43.040
so the old squad leader

303
15:43.040 --> 15:44.640
wouldn't meet the conditions for work injury compensation.

304
15:44.640 --> 15:46.970
Isn't he just a bad guy exploiting the law?

305
15:47.400 --> 15:49.160
We absolutely can't let him succeed.

306
15:49.160 --> 15:50.120
Let's do this.

307
15:50.760 --> 15:52.360
We'll split into two groups.

308
15:52.400 --> 15:54.600
You two go to the hospital tomorrow

309
15:54.760 --> 15:56.280
and carefully investigate

310
15:56.280 --> 15:58.760
the details of the old squad leader's rescue.

311
15:58.760 --> 15:59.440
Sister-in-law said

312
15:59.440 --> 16:02.440
the old squad leader lost his phone the day he fell ill.

313
16:02.520 --> 16:03.580
I'll go look for it.

314
16:03.880 --> 16:07.080
There's a high chance evidence of his work is on his phone.

315
16:07.080 --> 16:08.240
I'll go with you.

316
16:08.680 --> 16:09.280
Okay.

317
16:15.000 --> 16:16.730
What's up? Is something wrong?

318
16:17.560 --> 16:19.240
No, just navigating.

319
16:19.520 --> 16:21.850
Aren't we going to the hospital tomorrow?

320
16:24.360 --> 16:25.040
Here you go.

321
16:25.040 --> 16:25.970
Okay, thank you.

322
16:26.960 --> 16:28.290
Got it, sister-in-law.

323
16:37.160 --> 16:39.400
This Yang Fan should be

324
16:39.400 --> 16:41.680
the last client the old squad leader saw.

325
16:45.960 --> 16:46.520
Hello?

326
16:47.440 --> 16:48.560
Hello, Mr. Tian.

327
16:48.680 --> 16:50.280
I finally got through to you.

328
16:50.520 --> 16:51.880
The gift you ordered at our store

329
16:51.880 --> 16:52.960
is ready.

330
16:53.200 --> 16:55.560
You can come pick it up anytime today.

331
16:56.920 --> 16:57.400
Hello?

332
16:58.080 --> 16:58.960
Thank you.

333
17:01.920 --> 17:02.600
Tomorrow

334
17:03.000 --> 17:05.260
is my wedding anniversary with Lao Tian.

335
17:06.200 --> 17:08.160
I told him not to waste money.

336
17:08.960 --> 17:10.220
He's so busy with work.

337
17:10.720 --> 17:12.240
Why did he even buy a gift?

338
17:22.560 --> 17:23.359
Director Liu.

339
17:23.720 --> 17:26.359
The work injury certification from the Human Resources and Social Security Bureau is out.

340
17:26.359 --> 17:30.090
I hope you can compensate Lawyer Tian's family as soon as possible.

341
17:30.120 --> 17:32.000
Lawyer Xiao, look.

342
17:32.720 --> 17:34.760
It says brain death here.

343
17:35.520 --> 17:37.120
We are all in the legal profession,

344
17:37.120 --> 17:38.480
so you must know

345
17:38.720 --> 17:42.180
that in practice, the law recognizes cardiopulmonary death.

346
17:42.280 --> 17:44.960
Brain death is only a medical certification.

347
17:45.320 --> 17:46.120
Director Liu.

348
17:46.760 --> 17:48.040
In judicial practice,

349
17:48.320 --> 17:49.980
there are already precedents

350
17:50.120 --> 17:51.840
using brain death to determine death.

351
17:51.840 --> 17:53.280
If we can't negotiate,

352
17:53.480 --> 17:54.740
then let's go to court.

353
17:55.640 --> 17:56.440
Director Liu.

354
17:56.880 --> 17:58.280
Since we are both in the legal profession,

355
17:58.280 --> 17:58.840
there is no need

356
17:58.840 --> 18:00.560
to make this matter so complicated.

357
18:00.560 --> 18:01.600
Lawyer Tian has been at your firm,

358
18:01.600 --> 18:03.400
serving diligently for so long.

359
18:03.760 --> 18:05.560
He deserves this compensation.

360
18:05.560 --> 18:06.160
Lawyer Li.

361
18:06.880 --> 18:10.040
My firm isn't as wealthy as your Honghu.

362
18:10.320 --> 18:12.240
I can't let Tian alone

363
18:12.320 --> 18:14.040
take my firm's profits from the past few years.

364
18:14.040 --> 18:15.320
If we fill it all in,

365
18:15.760 --> 18:17.760
how will the other lawyers survive?

366
18:18.160 --> 18:19.420
You're exaggerating.

367
18:19.560 --> 18:20.690
Look, Director Liu.

368
18:21.200 --> 18:22.600
This is your law firm's win rate

369
18:22.600 --> 18:23.720
and caseload.

370
18:24.280 --> 18:26.280
The profit should be more than this.

371
18:27.880 --> 18:30.520
It's just for marketing purposes.

372
18:30.760 --> 18:32.480
Then that's data falsification.

373
18:32.480 --> 18:33.160
In the past two years,

374
18:33.160 --> 18:34.760
the Justice Bureau and the Bar Association

375
18:34.760 --> 18:36.560
have been cracking down on this behavior.

376
18:36.560 --> 18:38.400
The law firm really doesn't have that much money.

377
18:38.400 --> 18:39.320
If we did...

378
18:39.320 --> 18:40.440
He's been with me for so many years.

379
18:40.440 --> 18:41.760
I don't want to treat him unfairly.

380
18:41.760 --> 18:43.240
You don't want to treat him unfairly?

381
18:43.240 --> 18:45.320
Then why didn't you provide him with social security?

382
18:45.320 --> 18:46.600
You don't want to treat him unfairly.

383
18:46.600 --> 18:49.040
Yet you make him work over 15 hours a day.

384
18:49.160 --> 18:51.480
Do you treat him as a human being or a consumable?

385
18:51.480 --> 18:53.560
Isn't the whole industry like this?

386
18:53.840 --> 18:55.320
The competition is so fierce.

387
18:55.320 --> 18:57.480
Who isn't working from dawn to dusk?

388
18:57.640 --> 18:59.700
Even me, the director of the law firm.

389
18:59.800 --> 19:02.320
I also have to run around to find cases,

390
19:02.320 --> 19:05.480
and be called over to entertain clients anytime, anywhere.

391
19:05.480 --> 19:06.840
I'm used to it.

392
19:06.840 --> 19:08.300
What kind of habit is that?

393
19:08.600 --> 19:10.040
Isn't it a bad practice?

394
19:10.320 --> 19:11.600
Shouldn't we unite

395
19:11.600 --> 19:13.040
and change this toxic culture?

396
19:13.040 --> 19:14.720
Why are you compromising with it?

397
19:14.720 --> 19:15.920
Lawyer Xiao is right.

398
19:16.080 --> 19:17.360
Unhealthy unspoken industry rules

399
19:17.360 --> 19:18.960
should indeed be boycotted.

400
19:19.240 --> 19:20.760
If even a law firm cannot

401
19:20.760 --> 19:21.920
respect the Labor Law,

402
19:21.920 --> 19:23.400
how can we make clients believe

403
19:23.400 --> 19:26.460
that the law will protect the lives of ordinary people?

404
19:27.840 --> 19:28.680
Director Liu.

405
19:29.560 --> 19:30.760
I have a proposal.

406
19:31.360 --> 19:32.960
We can pay this compensation

407
19:33.120 --> 19:35.720
in installments

408
19:36.120 --> 19:37.520
to Lawyer Tian's family.

409
19:38.840 --> 19:41.080
This way, your finances won't take a huge hit.

410
19:41.080 --> 19:43.640
Honghu will have some outsourced cases.

411
19:44.080 --> 19:46.410
I can help connect you when the time comes.

412
19:50.720 --> 19:52.320
Thanks to you, Lawyer Li.

413
19:52.760 --> 19:54.760
Because you prepared a trump card in advance,

414
19:54.760 --> 19:56.690
the negotiation went so smoothly.

415
19:56.880 --> 19:57.610
Impressive.

416
19:58.360 --> 19:59.720
That's not entirely accurate.

417
19:59.720 --> 20:01.520
Didn't we prepare it together?

418
20:02.840 --> 20:03.880
All this time,

419
20:06.320 --> 20:07.850
thank you for being with me.

420
20:12.680 --> 20:14.210
Isn't that what I should do?

421
20:14.840 --> 20:17.600
Otherwise, how could we join forces?

422
20:19.560 --> 20:20.960
You still remember that?

423
20:22.480 --> 20:23.520
I never forgot.

424
20:33.520 --> 20:34.760
That director of Qianyue Law Firm,

425
20:34.760 --> 20:36.600
he didn't want to pay compensation from the start.

426
20:36.600 --> 20:37.640
He even dragged out the rescue time

427
20:37.640 --> 20:39.760
past the standard for work-related injury recognition.

428
20:39.760 --> 20:40.840
How shameless.

429
20:40.960 --> 20:41.640
Yes.

430
20:41.640 --> 20:42.880
Do you need my help?

431
20:43.640 --> 20:44.840
That won't be necessary.

432
20:44.840 --> 20:47.700
The director and Lawyer Li have already handled it.

433
20:47.880 --> 20:50.280
Then just tell me the conclusion next time.

434
20:50.480 --> 20:51.640
Uncle, you told me

435
20:51.640 --> 20:53.440
to tell you the details of the process.

436
20:53.440 --> 20:54.520
I was just saying. Alright, alright.

437
20:54.520 --> 20:55.360
Anyway,

438
20:55.360 --> 20:57.800
no matter what happens in the law firm from now on,

439
20:57.800 --> 20:59.280
you report to me first.

440
20:59.920 --> 21:00.600
Okay.

441
21:00.800 --> 21:01.560
Keep that in mind.

442
21:01.560 --> 21:03.400
Come, come. Please.

443
21:03.920 --> 21:06.850
I'm telling you, eat well, drink well, and wash well.

444
21:07.160 --> 21:08.640
Uncle, it's Liu Xincheng.

445
21:12.040 --> 21:12.840
Director Liu.

446
21:15.560 --> 21:16.520
You know me?

447
21:17.040 --> 21:18.360
Important people have short memories.

448
21:18.360 --> 21:20.960
We met at Lawyer Tian's funeral.

449
21:21.280 --> 21:22.520
Look at me.

450
21:22.520 --> 21:23.320
My memory is so bad.

451
21:23.320 --> 21:24.840
Go, enjoy yourselves.

452
21:24.840 --> 21:26.120
Okay, please go upstairs, you two.

453
21:26.120 --> 21:27.760
Goodbye. Let's go.

454
21:29.520 --> 21:30.780
I know him, Brother Hu.

455
21:32.280 --> 21:33.400
Find Director Liu

456
21:33.400 --> 21:35.120
the strongest bath attendant.

457
21:35.120 --> 21:37.400
He's a dirty guy.

458
21:37.400 --> 21:38.660
His heart is not clean.

459
21:38.840 --> 21:39.560
Understood.

460
21:39.560 --> 21:40.360
I'll go myself.

461
21:40.360 --> 21:41.920
I'll scrub his soul clean.

462
21:41.920 --> 21:43.320
I'll let him know what pain is.

463
21:43.320 --> 21:44.380
Sting him to death.

464
21:54.000 --> 21:54.520
Ms. Xiao.

465
21:54.520 --> 21:56.200
I beg you, please help me.

466
21:56.240 --> 21:57.720
No one believes me now,

467
21:57.720 --> 21:59.960
and no one dares to take Wangang's case.

468
22:00.920 --> 22:01.800
I'm sorry.

469
22:02.120 --> 22:03.600
I've said all I have to say.

470
22:03.600 --> 22:04.560
I can't help you.

471
22:05.120 --> 22:05.960
Did you hear that?

472
22:05.960 --> 22:07.720
Our law firm can't take your case.

473
22:07.720 --> 22:09.980
If you come again, we'll call the police.

474
22:23.920 --> 22:25.120
We came to see you.

475
22:29.360 --> 22:32.240
Longnv and Lawyer Li

476
22:32.520 --> 22:35.780
helped you apply for work-related injury certification.

477
22:37.280 --> 22:39.280
The compensation has come through.

478
22:40.040 --> 22:41.080
My son and I

479
22:41.200 --> 22:43.400
will be financially secure from now on.

480
22:44.200 --> 22:45.240
Rest assured.

481
22:46.360 --> 22:47.480
I won't break down.

482
22:49.440 --> 22:51.100
I will live a good life for you.

483
22:59.440 --> 23:00.440
Old squad leader.

484
23:01.920 --> 23:02.840
Rest assured.

485
23:24.920 --> 23:26.520
Excuse me for interrupting.

486
23:27.560 --> 23:28.440
I am the last client

487
23:28.440 --> 23:30.170
Lawyer Tian saw before he died.

488
23:35.480 --> 23:38.360
Actually, I owe Lawyer Tian a lot.

489
23:39.360 --> 23:41.120
At first, I chose Lawyer Tian.

490
23:42.760 --> 23:44.080
Lawyer Tian, this is the termination of the contract.

491
23:44.080 --> 23:45.080
Later, I heard

492
23:45.160 --> 23:47.000
it took him three years to pass the bar exam.

493
23:47.000 --> 23:49.280
I thought he probably wasn't capable enough,

494
23:49.280 --> 23:50.480
so I changed lawyers.

495
23:50.840 --> 23:51.840
Please stay.

496
23:51.880 --> 23:53.010
No need to see me out.

497
23:55.080 --> 23:56.080
But that lawyer

498
23:56.080 --> 23:57.840
was obviously not as responsible as Lawyer Tian.

499
23:57.840 --> 23:58.920
Have you waited long, Mr. Yang?

500
23:58.920 --> 24:00.380
I went back to Lawyer Tian.

501
24:00.920 --> 24:02.960
But Lawyer Tian's attitude towards my case

502
24:02.960 --> 24:04.220
hadn't changed at all.

503
24:04.560 --> 24:06.840
I even asked him how he did it.

504
24:07.720 --> 24:08.600
What did he say?

505
24:09.600 --> 24:11.120
He recited an oath to me.

506
24:12.080 --> 24:13.360
But I remember after he finished,

507
24:13.360 --> 24:15.420
he smiled good-naturedly and told me

508
24:15.600 --> 24:17.320
that the oath didn't teach him

509
24:17.320 --> 24:18.920
to get angry with the client.

510
24:31.240 --> 24:32.280
Since I started practicing,

511
24:32.280 --> 24:34.540
it was the first time I got hit by a client.

512
24:34.560 --> 24:37.200
I felt wronged and angry at the time.

513
24:37.680 --> 24:40.000
But after calming down, I reflected

514
24:40.360 --> 24:42.600
that maybe I didn't emphasize the consequences of losing the case

515
24:42.600 --> 24:44.720
enough.

516
24:45.200 --> 24:46.960
In the morning, I accompanied my supervising lawyer

517
24:46.960 --> 24:49.200
to the detention center to pick up our client.

518
24:49.200 --> 24:52.280
As soon as he came out, he hugged the lawyer and sobbed,

519
24:52.280 --> 24:54.240
saying it was like being reborn.

520
24:54.640 --> 24:57.120
This was the first criminal case I encountered,

521
24:57.120 --> 24:59.720
and I deeply felt the importance of a good lawyer

522
24:59.720 --> 25:02.160
to a client's fate.

523
25:02.440 --> 25:03.120
Today,

524
25:03.280 --> 25:05.560
I finally passed the bar exam

525
25:05.600 --> 25:07.960
and became an intern lawyer.

526
25:08.240 --> 25:10.680
I once read in a book

527
25:10.720 --> 25:13.320
that someone described the medical profession like this:

528
25:13.320 --> 25:16.040
To cure sometimes, to relieve often,

529
25:16.200 --> 25:17.400
to comfort always.

530
25:17.880 --> 25:20.000
I think lawyers should be the same.

531
25:20.000 --> 25:21.680
I volunteer to dedicate myself to the political and legal cause,

532
25:21.680 --> 25:24.000
love the motherland, be loyal to the people,

533
25:24.000 --> 25:25.760
uphold the humanistic spirit,

534
25:25.880 --> 25:27.600
and relentlessly pursue truth.

535
25:27.600 --> 25:29.320
To wield the sword of justice,

536
25:29.320 --> 25:31.120
hold the scales of fairness,

537
25:31.120 --> 25:32.880
eliminate evil from the world,

538
25:32.880 --> 25:34.880
and protect the sanctity of the law.

539
25:34.880 --> 25:38.600
I will strive for the construction of socialist rule of law for my whole life,

540
25:38.600 --> 25:40.040
unwaveringly.

541
25:40.040 --> 25:41.840
Oath taker, Tian Yonghou.

542
26:10.800 --> 26:11.560
Today,

543
26:11.680 --> 26:13.960
I finally got my own lawyer's license.

544
26:14.000 --> 26:16.760
Congratulations.

545
26:17.960 --> 26:19.360
So that means from now on,

546
26:19.600 --> 26:21.480
we should call you Little Lawyer Wang.

547
26:21.480 --> 26:22.800
What do you mean "Little Lawyer Wang"?

548
26:22.800 --> 26:24.920
She is officially Lawyer Wang now.

549
26:25.040 --> 26:26.720
Lawyer Wang.

550
26:27.960 --> 26:29.480
Lawyer Li, you should call her that too.

551
26:29.480 --> 26:30.210
Lawyer Wang.

552
26:30.680 --> 26:32.210
You must be secretly happy.

553
26:33.680 --> 26:34.920
I'm sorry, everyone.

554
26:35.920 --> 26:38.760
I don't plan to be Lawyer Wang yet.

555
26:40.080 --> 26:41.480
What do you mean?

556
26:41.560 --> 26:43.890
Haven't you had enough of the internship?

557
26:44.360 --> 26:47.560
I'm going to apply to NYU School of Law

558
26:48.320 --> 26:49.560
for further studies.

559
26:49.560 --> 26:50.760
This is too sudden.

560
26:51.320 --> 26:52.840
Have you thought it through?

561
26:52.840 --> 26:54.640
Although I hate to leave you all,

562
26:55.880 --> 26:58.540
this is the result of my careful consideration.

563
27:05.160 --> 27:06.280
I'm very happy

564
27:06.600 --> 27:08.720
to have met you all as soon as I entered the workplace.

565
27:08.720 --> 27:10.840
But I want to take advantage of my youth

566
27:10.840 --> 27:12.800
to go out and see the world.

567
27:12.920 --> 27:14.200
Until I can figure out

568
27:14.200 --> 27:15.320
exactly what kind of lawyer

569
27:15.320 --> 27:16.280
I want to be.

570
27:16.760 --> 27:19.960
I believe you can definitely do it.

571
27:20.160 --> 27:22.720
After you've looked around,

572
27:23.240 --> 27:24.840
you're welcome back to our team.

573
27:24.840 --> 27:27.240
Don't look down on us then.

574
27:28.200 --> 27:29.260
That's hard to say.

575
27:31.800 --> 27:32.520
Bowen.

576
27:32.520 --> 27:33.800
I'm not drunk.

577
27:33.800 --> 27:34.600
Okay, okay.

578
27:35.360 --> 27:36.160
My glasses.

579
27:38.720 --> 27:39.840
Take good care of him.

580
27:39.840 --> 27:40.480
Okay, Ruoqi.

581
27:40.480 --> 27:41.080
Boss.

582
27:41.160 --> 27:42.400
Hold this for him in case he throws up.

583
27:42.400 --> 27:43.440
I won't see you off.

584
27:43.440 --> 27:44.440
Bye, boss. Bye, Ruoqi.

585
27:44.440 --> 27:45.160
Ruoqi.

586
27:45.600 --> 27:46.920
I will miss you.

587
27:50.360 --> 27:51.080
Lawyer Li.

588
27:51.600 --> 27:53.200
We agreed I would pay for this meal.

589
27:53.200 --> 27:54.480
Why did you pay again?

590
27:55.960 --> 27:57.360
Since you graduated from Honghu

591
27:57.360 --> 27:58.440
and call me your mentor,

592
27:58.440 --> 28:00.560
it's only natural for me to treat you to a meal.

593
28:00.560 --> 28:01.560
Let's wait until you come back.

594
28:01.560 --> 28:03.160
I'll treat everyone to a meal then.

595
28:03.160 --> 28:05.000
Okay. Thank you, Mr. Li.

596
28:05.600 --> 28:06.600
Did you call a cab?

597
28:06.920 --> 28:08.440
Yes. It'll be here in a few minutes.

598
28:08.440 --> 28:10.300
Okay. I'll wait with you for a bit.

599
28:14.160 --> 28:15.680
I'm leaving anyway.

600
28:16.280 --> 28:19.120
I want to be honest with you.

601
28:22.840 --> 28:23.520
Go ahead.

602
28:24.640 --> 28:26.240
Although your name is Li Xin,

603
28:26.920 --> 28:29.200
I don't think you need to live up to it

604
28:29.240 --> 28:31.840
by being rational all the time.

605
28:32.240 --> 28:33.000
When you work,

606
28:33.000 --> 28:34.000
don't push yourself too hard.

607
28:34.000 --> 28:35.320
Your health is very important.

608
28:35.320 --> 28:36.080
The way you are

609
28:36.080 --> 28:38.280
makes the people close to you worry.

610
28:38.400 --> 28:39.840
And most importantly,

611
28:40.360 --> 28:42.560
don't always close your heart

612
28:43.160 --> 28:45.000
and shut everyone out.

613
28:47.720 --> 28:48.320
Okay.

614
28:49.320 --> 28:50.920
I've received your lecture.

615
28:51.000 --> 28:52.280
I will reflect on it.

616
28:52.960 --> 28:54.360
Why does it sound like you're leaving

617
28:54.360 --> 28:56.600
and taking the chance to scold me?

618
28:56.720 --> 28:57.840
I'm not done yet.

619
28:58.800 --> 28:59.840
Okay, go on.

620
29:01.240 --> 29:03.170
You also have many good qualities.

621
29:03.240 --> 29:04.040
Capable,

622
29:05.480 --> 29:06.440
responsible,

623
29:06.920 --> 29:07.840
principled,

624
29:08.320 --> 29:10.400
very accountable and reliable.

625
29:10.840 --> 29:11.970
I like you very much.

626
29:18.920 --> 29:19.960
Did I scare you?

627
29:21.200 --> 29:21.680
No.

628
29:23.040 --> 29:24.040
Don't be nervous.

629
29:24.240 --> 29:25.920
I don't need you to respond.

630
29:27.040 --> 29:28.120
I just think

631
29:28.680 --> 29:31.440
liking someone is a beautiful thing.

632
29:32.840 --> 29:34.170
I wanted to let you know.

633
29:35.560 --> 29:36.440
That's all.

634
29:39.360 --> 29:40.040
Thank you.

635
29:40.280 --> 29:43.360
So, can you let Lawyer Xiao

636
29:43.840 --> 29:45.200
know your feelings too?

637
29:48.160 --> 29:49.200
I can tell

638
29:49.640 --> 29:51.160
you treat Lawyer Xiao

639
29:51.160 --> 29:52.800
differently from others.

640
29:54.040 --> 29:55.320
Did you give up

641
29:55.560 --> 29:56.600
the offer in Hong Kong

642
29:56.600 --> 29:57.640
because of her?

643
29:58.600 --> 30:00.060
Your resume is excellent.

644
30:03.280 --> 30:04.040
Tell me.

645
30:04.640 --> 30:06.120
Why do you want to come to Honghu?

646
30:06.120 --> 30:06.720
I...

647
30:08.040 --> 30:08.800
Come in.

648
30:09.640 --> 30:11.900
Director, I've finished this document.

649
30:14.160 --> 30:14.920
Li Xin.

650
30:15.160 --> 30:16.160
Why are you here?

651
30:19.720 --> 30:22.050
Have you really decided to come to Honghu?

652
30:24.960 --> 30:26.600
Didn't you receive an offer

653
30:26.600 --> 30:28.130
from a big firm in Hong Kong?

654
30:29.680 --> 30:31.920
I can be the best lawyer anywhere.

655
30:32.600 --> 30:33.880
Besides, didn't we say

656
30:33.880 --> 30:36.000
we'd join forces after graduation?

657
30:36.400 --> 30:38.880
Good for you. You kept your word.

658
30:40.800 --> 30:42.330
Travel the world together.

659
30:42.600 --> 30:43.130
Let's go.

660
30:46.840 --> 30:48.320
That's obviously love.

661
30:48.440 --> 30:50.040
Why are you afraid to say it?

662
30:52.280 --> 30:54.140
If you keep hesitating like this,

663
30:54.560 --> 30:56.240
you might really lose her.

664
31:40.480 --> 31:41.360
Standing here

665
31:41.800 --> 31:42.840
to welcome me?

666
31:44.360 --> 31:45.480
Flattered?

667
31:49.200 --> 31:50.800
I have something to tell you.

668
31:51.520 --> 31:52.560
What a coincidence.

669
31:52.560 --> 31:54.360
I have something to tell you too.

670
31:55.520 --> 31:56.250
You go first.

671
32:04.480 --> 32:06.360
I'm going to take Old Pan's case.

672
32:08.920 --> 32:12.320
While handling the old squad leader's funeral,

673
32:13.200 --> 32:14.400
I kept thinking about

674
32:15.200 --> 32:17.440
what we used to say when we were kids:

675
32:17.440 --> 32:18.920
"Wielding the sword of justice."

676
32:18.920 --> 32:20.450
What are we wielding it for?

677
32:21.560 --> 32:22.920
Then I figured it out.

678
32:23.280 --> 32:24.360
Isn't it to

679
32:24.920 --> 32:26.560
help those who suffer injustice

680
32:26.560 --> 32:27.760
get justice?

681
32:28.000 --> 32:29.730
This is my original intention.

682
32:30.200 --> 32:30.880
I can't say that

683
32:30.880 --> 32:32.640
just because Old Pan stood me up once,

684
32:32.640 --> 32:34.440
I forgot my original intention.

685
32:34.760 --> 32:36.440
Now that Old Pan is facing injustice,

686
32:36.440 --> 32:38.880
I have to wield the sword of justice for him.

687
32:39.760 --> 32:40.440
Right?

688
32:45.080 --> 32:45.800
I

689
32:47.360 --> 32:48.690
respect your decision.

690
32:49.800 --> 32:51.120
Since you've already drawn your sword,

691
32:51.120 --> 32:53.120
I have no choice but to draw my blade.

692
32:53.480 --> 32:56.120
Let's be opponents one more time.

693
32:57.080 --> 32:58.340
Bring it on, opponent.

694
33:28.320 --> 33:29.780
Thank you, Attorney Xiao.

695
33:29.880 --> 33:31.080
Thank you so much.

696
33:31.240 --> 33:34.840
I really didn't expect you to take my case.

697
33:34.840 --> 33:35.770
You're welcome.

698
33:36.120 --> 33:38.320
Well, let's go check out the situation.

699
33:39.080 --> 33:41.200
Last year, the shrimp farming failed.

700
33:41.200 --> 33:43.400
This year, I wanted to go big,

701
33:43.760 --> 33:46.200
so I invested twice as much money as last year.

702
33:46.200 --> 33:47.200
To get this loan,

703
33:47.200 --> 33:49.080
I even mortgaged my house.

704
33:49.520 --> 33:50.720
I never expected this.

705
33:50.720 --> 33:54.160
All this money has gone down the drain.

706
33:55.080 --> 33:55.760
Look.

707
34:00.080 --> 34:02.410
Are other farmers experiencing this too?

708
34:02.680 --> 34:04.680
Anyone farming in these waters

709
34:05.120 --> 34:06.280
has suffered.

710
34:06.280 --> 34:08.440
Now they're acting just like last year.

711
34:08.440 --> 34:10.159
If I win, they'll sue.

712
34:10.560 --> 34:12.280
If I lose, they'll lay low.

713
34:12.440 --> 34:14.239
Those shrimp stink.

714
34:14.440 --> 34:16.480
Why haven't you scooped them out if they've been dead so long?

715
34:16.480 --> 34:19.719
We don't dare scoop them out until we get an explanation.

716
34:20.920 --> 34:22.239
Have you talked to Wangang?

717
34:22.239 --> 34:23.159
I did.

718
34:23.360 --> 34:24.489
They won't admit it.

719
34:25.040 --> 34:27.880
The situation this year is the same as last year.

720
34:28.080 --> 34:29.409
I won't bother anymore.

721
34:29.600 --> 34:30.719
Just let Wangang and the others

722
34:30.719 --> 34:32.440
compensate us according to last year's standard.

723
34:32.440 --> 34:33.239
Sorry, Mr. Pan.

724
34:33.239 --> 34:35.040
I have to correct your wording.

725
34:35.600 --> 34:38.120
Last year, Wangang didn't call it compensation.

726
34:38.120 --> 34:39.719
Instead, out of humanitarianism,

727
34:39.719 --> 34:41.040
they contacted a third-party company

728
34:41.040 --> 34:42.560
to buy all your shrimp.

729
34:47.080 --> 34:48.520
This is just an ordinary

730
34:48.520 --> 34:50.480
third-party shrimp purchase contract.

731
34:50.480 --> 34:53.480
Wangang indeed didn't admit to the sewage discharge.

732
35:01.000 --> 35:01.680
Mr. Wan.

733
35:02.440 --> 35:03.720
Last year's pipeline damage

734
35:03.720 --> 35:04.920
was just an accident.

735
35:05.320 --> 35:06.720
This year, we specifically added

736
35:06.720 --> 35:08.080
several quality control measures.

737
35:08.080 --> 35:11.080
I can guarantee there will be absolutely no problems.

738
35:13.520 --> 35:14.200
Mr. Wan,

739
35:14.720 --> 35:16.720
there's a document you need to sign.

740
35:16.920 --> 35:19.050
No rush. We'll talk after the meeting.

741
35:25.840 --> 35:28.160
You don't need to wait. Go do your work.

742
35:28.400 --> 35:29.880
It's such an important meeting.

743
35:29.880 --> 35:31.140
I want to participate.

744
35:31.200 --> 35:32.760
Just in case I can be of help.

745
35:32.800 --> 35:33.800
Please continue.

746
35:35.520 --> 35:36.720
Well, no matter what,

747
35:36.720 --> 35:38.440
since it has already happened,

748
35:38.440 --> 35:40.480
Let's figure out a way to solve it quickly.

749
35:40.480 --> 35:42.600
I think Attorney Li's method last year

750
35:42.600 --> 35:44.400
pacified the farmers very well.

751
35:44.560 --> 35:47.220
Attorney Li, how about you go talk to them again?

752
35:47.480 --> 35:48.000
Sure.

753
35:48.560 --> 35:50.400
Could it be that these farmers

754
35:50.400 --> 35:52.460
got a taste of the benefits last year,

755
35:52.800 --> 35:54.360
and their appetite has grown this year,

756
35:54.360 --> 35:56.040
so they deliberately killed those shrimp

757
35:56.040 --> 35:57.240
to ask us for money?

758
35:57.360 --> 35:58.360
Is this possible?

759
35:58.480 --> 36:00.280
We can't rule out this possibility.

760
36:00.280 --> 36:01.040
But right now,

761
36:01.040 --> 36:03.100
the M&A negotiation with Nanfu Group

762
36:03.320 --> 36:04.520
is the top priority.

763
36:04.720 --> 36:05.720
My suggestion is

764
36:05.880 --> 36:08.480
to run tests first and control public opinion.

765
36:08.600 --> 36:10.080
It's more efficient

766
36:10.560 --> 36:12.240
than making baseless inferences.

767
36:12.240 --> 36:13.760
This is the key point.

768
36:14.080 --> 36:15.560
We are not afraid of lawsuits.

769
36:15.560 --> 36:16.280
What we are afraid of is

770
36:16.280 --> 36:18.400
public opinion ruining our reputation.

771
36:18.400 --> 36:20.880
This M&A is very important.

772
36:21.040 --> 36:22.440
Once the merger is successful,

773
36:22.440 --> 36:23.320
our Wangang

774
36:23.600 --> 36:26.720
will see a multi-billion expansion.

775
36:26.720 --> 36:28.580
So we must be extremely cautious.

776
36:29.200 --> 36:32.000
I heard the one representing the farmers

777
36:32.040 --> 36:34.400
is that Xiao Longnv from last year.

778
36:34.600 --> 36:35.200
Yes.

779
36:35.280 --> 36:36.360
Last year, she even sued one of our

780
36:36.360 --> 36:37.960
distributors named Hu.

781
36:38.200 --> 36:39.730
She's not easy to deal with.

782
36:39.800 --> 36:40.440
Lawyer Li.

783
36:40.560 --> 36:41.760
I'll have to trouble you

784
36:41.760 --> 36:43.440
to take care of this matter.

785
36:43.840 --> 36:45.640
We need to resolve this quickly.

786
36:45.640 --> 36:47.880
It's best if they withdraw the lawsuit.

787
36:51.760 --> 36:53.760
Do you have too much money and nowhere to spend it?

788
36:53.760 --> 36:56.490
You have some money burning a hole in your pocket.

789
36:56.560 --> 36:57.400
You could do anything else.

790
36:57.400 --> 36:58.640
But you want to invest in our law firm.

791
36:58.640 --> 37:00.500
Look at you, are you really not...

792
37:00.640 --> 37:02.640
What? Doubting my sincerity?

793
37:02.640 --> 37:04.120
Don't overthink it.

794
37:04.400 --> 37:07.200
I just feel this is too sudden.

795
37:07.680 --> 37:09.360
She treated you well back then.

796
37:09.360 --> 37:10.720
She took good care of you.

797
37:10.720 --> 37:11.920
I poached you away.

798
37:12.000 --> 37:13.400
So she must be feeling upset.

799
37:13.400 --> 37:15.440
Yes, I thought I'd inject some capital into her firm.

800
37:15.440 --> 37:17.760
If she does well, she'll remember your kindness.

801
37:17.760 --> 37:19.690
And if you do well, I do well, right?

802
37:19.760 --> 37:22.200
No wonder you can handle this massive wealth.

803
37:22.200 --> 37:24.400
You deserve to be the boss. You totally deserve it.

804
37:24.400 --> 37:25.480
Say no more.

805
37:25.880 --> 37:27.200
Good brothers for a lifetime.

806
37:27.200 --> 37:27.840
Two lifetimes.

807
37:27.840 --> 37:28.520
Three lifetimes.

808
37:28.520 --> 37:29.160
Four lifetimes.

809
37:29.160 --> 37:29.760
Five lifetimes.

810
37:29.760 --> 37:30.480
Six lifetimes.

811
37:30.480 --> 37:31.680
Then I'm going all in.

812
37:48.440 --> 37:49.440
Hu is back.

813
37:49.760 --> 37:51.680
You've really upgraded. You've made it.

814
37:51.680 --> 37:52.640
Call him Mr. Dong.

815
37:52.640 --> 37:53.520
Mr. Dong, Mr. Dong.

816
37:53.520 --> 37:54.360
How's business?

817
37:54.360 --> 37:54.920
Not bad, not bad.

818
37:54.920 --> 37:55.600
Not bad.

819
37:59.840 --> 38:00.960
Godmother.

820
38:04.200 --> 38:05.480
Dali.

821
38:06.720 --> 38:07.800
It really is you.

822
38:07.800 --> 38:08.730
I came to see you.

823
38:09.280 --> 38:10.280
You're too kind.

824
38:10.360 --> 38:12.080
My goodness, let me look at you.

825
38:12.080 --> 38:13.960
You look so different from when you were a kid.

826
38:13.960 --> 38:14.560
Am I handsome?

827
38:14.560 --> 38:15.200
Handsome.

828
38:17.360 --> 38:19.160
Look at Huzi now, looking so tough.

829
38:19.160 --> 38:20.090
Awesome, right?

830
38:20.400 --> 38:21.400
Awesome.

831
38:21.560 --> 38:23.400
Thanks for taking care of him.

832
38:24.080 --> 38:25.560
Did you pay him?

833
38:25.560 --> 38:26.600
What do you mean, pay him?

834
38:26.600 --> 38:28.640
Don't talk nonsense. We have business to attend to.

835
38:28.640 --> 38:30.360
We're going to visit his former boss.

836
38:30.360 --> 38:31.640
Going to see Lawyer Xiao, right?

837
38:31.640 --> 38:33.700
Make sure you introduce me properly.

838
38:38.120 --> 38:38.720
Uncle.

839
38:39.200 --> 38:40.440
Looking good, Mr. Dong.

840
38:40.440 --> 38:41.920
Suit and tie, very handsome.

841
38:41.920 --> 38:43.840
Of course. You kidding?

842
38:43.840 --> 38:44.160
How about that?

843
38:44.160 --> 38:45.040
You have a bodyguard now?

844
38:45.040 --> 38:47.280
What bodyguard? I'm his bodyguard.

845
38:47.440 --> 38:48.000
No.

846
38:48.000 --> 38:50.120
This is my boss and my childhood friend,

847
38:50.120 --> 38:51.400
Sun Zhuoli. No, no, no.

848
38:51.560 --> 38:52.360
Wan Zhuoli.

849
38:52.800 --> 38:55.000
And this is the director of our law firm, Xiao Longnv.

850
38:55.000 --> 38:56.320
Attorney Xiao, I've heard so much about you.

851
38:56.320 --> 38:57.680
Hello, Mr. Wan.

852
38:58.360 --> 38:59.000
This is great.

853
38:59.000 --> 39:00.560
Justice of Sword.

854
39:03.200 --> 39:04.800
What? It's Sword of Justice.

855
39:05.080 --> 39:06.080
No, don't we read it backwards?

856
39:06.080 --> 39:07.200
Read it forwards.

857
39:08.400 --> 39:10.880
That's great. It hasn't changed.

858
39:11.640 --> 39:13.200
Young man, have a cigar.

859
39:13.480 --> 39:14.000
Smoke it. Come on.

860
39:14.000 --> 39:15.120
Let your uncle cut it for you. Come on.

861
39:15.120 --> 39:15.960
No, no, no.

862
39:16.040 --> 39:18.480
Smoking is not allowed here. Don't you know?

863
39:18.480 --> 39:19.320
Isn't this a cigar?

864
39:19.320 --> 39:21.240
Is a cigar not a smoke? Doesn't it produce smoke?

865
39:21.240 --> 39:22.520
Then take it outside and smoke it yourself.

866
39:22.520 --> 39:24.120
I don't smoke either, Uncle.

867
39:26.640 --> 39:27.370
Lawyer Xiao.

868
39:27.600 --> 39:29.280
I heard you like to drink.

869
39:29.280 --> 39:31.480
I specially picked this bottle for you.

870
39:31.600 --> 39:33.560
It's just a small token of my appreciation. Please accept it.

871
39:33.560 --> 39:34.920
But I'm afraid I'm not used to it.

872
39:34.920 --> 39:36.840
I usually just drink beer.

873
39:36.840 --> 39:38.280
It's very expensive. Just take it.

874
39:38.280 --> 39:40.200
I wouldn't even bear to spit it out after drinking it.

875
39:40.200 --> 39:41.840
Making such a big fuss.

876
39:42.040 --> 39:44.080
Do you have something to ask of me, Mr. Wan?

877
39:44.080 --> 39:45.080
Do you have a case?

878
39:46.120 --> 39:48.120
It's not a case. It's a partnership.

879
39:48.280 --> 39:49.560
It's a great opportunity.

880
39:49.560 --> 39:51.560
Huzi has been praising you to me,

881
39:51.720 --> 39:54.040
saying you are very capable and excellent.

882
39:54.040 --> 39:55.200
I was thinking,

883
39:55.200 --> 39:56.640
such an excellent lawyer like you

884
39:56.640 --> 39:58.480
shouldn't be buried on this street.

885
39:58.480 --> 40:00.400
Then what do you mean, Mr. Wan?

886
40:00.440 --> 40:01.920
Where should I be buried?

887
40:04.120 --> 40:04.800
Humorous.

888
40:05.480 --> 40:07.920
I mean, I want to invest in your law firm.

889
40:08.520 --> 40:09.640
If we partner up,

890
40:09.880 --> 40:11.760
you just focus on going to court and handling cases,

891
40:11.760 --> 40:13.090
and leave the rest to me.

892
40:13.480 --> 40:15.360
I will first move this law firm

893
40:15.360 --> 40:16.690
out of this shabby place

894
40:16.920 --> 40:18.120
to the CBD.

895
40:18.120 --> 40:19.160
Rent an office building.

896
40:19.160 --> 40:20.720
We'll rent a whole floor.

897
40:21.240 --> 40:23.160
If we need people, just hire them.

898
40:23.160 --> 40:24.640
You're the boss. You call the shots.

899
40:24.640 --> 40:26.680
I'll get you a marketing team then.

900
40:26.680 --> 40:27.960
The most expensive kind.

901
40:27.960 --> 40:29.120
Promote it everywhere online,

902
40:29.120 --> 40:31.920
and make our law firm famous.

903
40:32.480 --> 40:34.080
That must cost a lot of money.

904
40:34.760 --> 40:35.400
Money?

905
40:35.400 --> 40:37.600
What money? Dali said,

906
40:37.600 --> 40:39.200
as long as it supports the legal cause,

907
40:39.200 --> 40:40.460
money doesn't matter.

908
40:40.480 --> 40:43.040
I'm telling you, this is a good opportunity. Seize it.

909
40:43.040 --> 40:44.520
Yes, it is a good opportunity.

910
40:44.520 --> 40:46.600
Since Mr. Wan supports the legal cause so much,

911
40:46.600 --> 40:47.720
what can our small law firm

912
40:47.720 --> 40:49.440
do to repay you?

913
40:51.640 --> 40:52.640
Here's the thing.

914
40:53.280 --> 40:54.680
I heard our law firm

915
40:54.840 --> 40:57.040
has recently been helping a farmer with a lawsuit.

916
40:57.040 --> 40:58.080
Is that true?

917
41:02.520 --> 41:04.640
Then let me ask you a question, Mr. Wan.

918
41:04.640 --> 41:07.880
Is your 'Wan' the same as in Wangang?

919
41:10.000 --> 41:12.240
What a coincidence.

920
41:13.320 --> 41:15.720
You're going to sue Wangang?

921
41:16.000 --> 41:17.680
Mr. Dong, this is your fault.

922
41:17.680 --> 41:19.120
You have such a powerful childhood friend,

923
41:19.120 --> 41:20.280
why didn't you say so earlier?

924
41:20.280 --> 41:21.840
Why are you staying in my small company?

925
41:21.840 --> 41:24.360
You should have joined your friend a long time ago.

926
41:24.360 --> 41:25.000
It's fine.

927
41:25.720 --> 41:27.650
Now that we're all on the same page,

928
41:27.800 --> 41:29.800
we can have a good talk, right?

929
41:29.800 --> 41:30.730
Talk about what?

930
41:31.400 --> 41:33.200
About withdrawing the lawsuit?

931
41:36.680 --> 41:37.520
No wonder

932
41:37.760 --> 41:39.720
Mr. Wan suddenly got interested.

933
41:39.720 --> 41:42.760
You want to invest in my small law firm?

934
41:42.920 --> 41:43.760
Ms. Xiao.

935
41:44.400 --> 41:46.060
Our cooperation is a win-win.

936
41:46.560 --> 41:48.480
Your law firm can grow,

937
41:48.680 --> 41:49.800
and Wangang

938
41:49.800 --> 41:51.800
can avoid some unnecessary trouble.

939
41:51.800 --> 41:52.860
Don't you think so?

940
41:53.080 --> 41:54.680
I don't understand, Mr. Wan.

941
41:55.320 --> 41:57.400
My client was treated unfairly.

942
41:57.600 --> 41:58.920
He wants to defend his rights.

943
41:58.920 --> 42:00.400
How is that trouble?

944
42:00.400 --> 42:01.640
There must be a misunderstanding.

945
42:01.640 --> 42:04.120
Ms. Xiao, don't be in a hurry to refuse me.

946
42:04.520 --> 42:05.480
Take your time to think about it.

947
42:05.480 --> 42:06.840
We can negotiate the terms.

948
42:06.840 --> 42:08.000
You are very busy.

949
42:08.000 --> 42:10.520
So you might not be familiar with the law.

950
42:10.760 --> 42:12.240
Let me explain it to you.

951
42:12.440 --> 42:14.760
If we keep talking, it means you're trying to bribe the opposing lawyer.

952
42:14.760 --> 42:15.960
This is illegal.

953
42:16.520 --> 42:18.580
If we continue, you'll need a lawyer.

954
42:19.480 --> 42:21.880
That would be very ugly, right?

955
42:22.640 --> 42:23.920
As for this wine,

956
42:25.200 --> 42:26.800
I really can't get used to it.

957
42:26.960 --> 42:29.360
Please take this expensive wine and leave.

958
42:32.080 --> 42:33.000
Why didn't you tell me

959
42:33.000 --> 42:35.520
that Ms. Xiao doesn't like to accept toasts?

960
42:36.680 --> 42:37.840
No, let's...

961
42:37.840 --> 42:38.920
Let's not be so tense, okay?

962
42:38.920 --> 42:39.840
Miao, see the guests out.

963
42:39.840 --> 42:42.440
I think there must be a misunderstanding here.

964
42:43.280 --> 42:43.880
After you.

965
42:48.000 --> 42:48.760
Dali.

966
42:52.080 --> 42:54.080
I didn't know he was going to talk about this.

967
42:54.080 --> 42:56.040
Let's go, Mr. Dong.
